Error [E0337]: `@[Patchable]` struct `View` field `owner` is a stored reference
  --> tests/ui/patchable_stored_ref.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     owner: &Owner
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: patches hold optional owned values — a patch can't express a borrowed field
 Fix: use an owned field type, or drop `@[Patchable]`
